hadiths[29]{hadithnumber,text}:
"543","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas kuch khajooren laya jo mere hath mein tartib se thin. Main ne kaha: 'Ya Rasulullah! Mere liye Allah se un mein barkat ki dua farmayen.' To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mere liye un mein barkat ki dua farmai, phir farmaya: 'Jab tum lena chaho to apna hath dalo aur unhen bikhairo nahin.' Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha: Main ne un khajooron mein se kitne wasq Allah ke raste mein diye. Rawi ne kaha: Ham un mein se khate aur khilate, aur woh mere kapde mein rahin yahan tak ke Usman (Raziyallahu anhu) ki shahadat ke dinon tak, jab woh khatm huin."
"544","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Zakariya (Alaihissalam) badhai the.'"
"545","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke ek aadmi doosri basti mein apne (Musalman) bhai ki ziyarat karta tha. Us ke raste mein ek farishta tha jis ne us se kaha: 'Tum kahan jane ka irada rakhte ho?' Us ne kaha: 'Main doosri basti mein apne bhai ki ziyarat ke liye ja raha hun.' Farishte ne poocha: 'Kya us ka tum par koi ehsan hai jis ka tum khayal rakhte ho?' Us ne kaha: 'Nahin, lekin main us se Allah ke liye muhabbat karta hun.' Farishte ne kaha: 'Main Allah ki taraf se tumhare paas paighambar hun (Us ne farmaya hai) ke jaise tum us se mere liye muhabbat karte ho, waise hi main tum se muhabbat karta hun.'"
"546","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mujhe kuch khajooren din. Main ne unhen apne ek tokre mein rakha aur use ghar ki chhat se latka diya. Ham us mein se khate rahe yahan tak ke woh us waqt khatm huin jab Ahle Sham ne Harrah par hamla kiya."
"547","[AI-translation] Ismail bin Muslim ne isi sanad se isi tarah riwayat ki, lekin unhon ne alfaz «بِآخِرِه» ka zikr nahin kiya."
"548","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Us Zaat ki qasam jis ke hath mein meri jaan hai! Beshak main kuch logon ko apne Hawz (Hawz Kausar) se zaroor hataunga jaise ajnabi oonton ko hawz se hataya jata hai.'"
"549","[AI-translation] Muhammad bin Ziyad se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) ko bayan karte suna: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Phir unhon ne pichli hadees ki manind bayan ki. Shu'bah (Rahimahullah) ne kaha: Jaise ajnabi oonton ko hataya jata hai, mera khayal hai unhon ne kaha: ... hawz se."
"550","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Agar Ansar ek wadi mein chalen aur doosre log doosri wadi mein chalen to main Ansar ki wadi mein chalunga, aur agar hijrat na hoti to main Ansar mein se hota.' Phir Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha: Mere maan baap Aap par qurban, Aap ne koi zulm nahin kiya, unhon (Ansar) ne Aap ko panah di aur Aap ki madad ki."
"551","[AI-translation] Doosri sanad se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se wohi riwayat bayan ki gai hai."
"552","[AI-translation] Shababah ne isi sanad se pichli hadees ki manind riwayat ki."
"553","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Tum mein se behtareen (daur) mera daur hai, phir woh jo un ke baad aaenge, aur phir woh jo un ke baad aaenge.' Rawi kahta hai: Main nahin janta Aap ne daur ka teesri martaba zikr farmaya ya nahin. Aap ne farmaya: 'Phir ek qaum aaegi jo motape se muhabbat karegi; woh gawahi denge jabke un ki gawahi talab nahin ki jayegi.'"
"554","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Log sone chaandi ki kanon ki manind hain, jo zamana jahiliyyat mein behtar the woh Islam mein bhi behtar hain, jab woh samajh (deen ki) hasil karen.'"
"555","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Jab se main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se Bani Tamim ke bare mein teen khoobiyan suni hain, main ne un se muhabbat ki hai (aur yeh muhabbat jari rahegi). Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Woh meri ummat mein Dajjal ke muqable mein sab se mazboot aur sab se sakht hain.' Un ki ek laundi Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) ke paas thi, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Use aazad karo, kyunke woh Bani Ismail mein se hai.' Aur jab Bani Tamim ka sadaqa aaya to Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Yeh hamari qaum ka sadaqa hai.'"
"556","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Tum logon ko kanon (sone chaandi) ki manind paoge, to jo zamana jahiliyyat mein behtar the woh Islam mein behtar honge, basharteke woh deen ki samajh hasil karen. Tum is (qiyadat/hukumat) ke liye sab se munasib use paoge jo un mein se use sab se ziyada napasand karta ho, aur tum un mein se badtareen use paoge jo do chehron wala ho, jo in logon ke paas ek chehre se aata hai aur un logon ke paas doosre chehre se.'"
"557","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Jo in donon se muhabbat kare, yani Hasan aur Husain (Raziyallahu anhuma), us ne mujh se muhabbat ki. Aur jo un se dushmani rakhe us ne mujh se dushmani rakhi.'"
"558","[AI-translation] Qabsiyah ne isi sanad se pichli hadees ki manind riwayat ki, yani Hasan aur Husain (Raziyallahu anhuma) ke bare mein."
"559","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Aaj main jhanda us shakhs ko dunga jo Allah aur Us ke Rasool se muhabbat karta hai.' Rawi ne kaha: To muazzaz sahaba (Raziyallahu anhum) ne is (jhande) ke milne ki ummeed ki (aur woh dekhne lage ke jhanda kise milega). Phir Aap ne farmaya: 'Ali kahan hai?' Aap ko bataya gaya ke un ki aankh dukh rahi hai, to Aap ne unhen bulaya aur apne hath par luaab lagaya aur us se un ki aankh par lagaya, phir unhen hukm diya ke jao aur jang karo. To Allah ne us din un ke hath par fath di. Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne apne ghar walon ko teen din tak gehn ki roti sair ho kar nahin khilai."
"560","[AI-translation] Isi sanad se: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jo deen mein koi nai cheez nikale ya kisi bid'ati (nai cheez nikalne wale) ko panah de, us par Allah, farishton, aur tamam logon ki la'nat hai. Us ka koi nafl ya farz amal qabool nahin kiya jayega.'"
"561","[AI-translation] Isi sanad se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Beshak Allah Ta'ala ne mujhe paigham ke sath bheja, to mera seena tang hua aur main ne jana ke log mujhe jhutlayenge. Phir Allah ne mujhe khabardar farmaya ke main use zaroor pahunchaun warna Woh mujhe azab dega.'"
"562","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Agar deen Surayya (Khusha Parveen) par hota, tab bhi Fars mein se log wahan pahunchte aur use (wahan se) hasil karte.'"
"563","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Jo Ahle Madina se jang kare, Allah us se jang karega.' Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Woh aise ghulega jaise namak pani mein ghulta hai.'"
"564","[AI-translation] Isi sanad se: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Isa bin Maryam (Alaihissalam) ne ek aadmi ko chori karte dekha, to us se kaha: Kya tum ne chori ki? Us ne kaha: Nahin, Us ki qasam jis ke siwa koi mabud nahin. To Isa (Alaihissalam) ne kaha: Main Allah par iman laya aur apni aankh ko jhoota qarar deta hun.'"
"565","[AI-translation] Isi sanad se: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Us Zaat ki qasam jis ke hath mein meri jaan hai! Madina ki masjid (Masjid Nabawi) mein ek namaz padhna doosri masjidon mein hazaar namazen padhne se behtar hai, siwae Ka'ba (Makkah mein Masjid Haram) ke.'"
"566","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Meri is masjid mein ek namaz doosri masjidon mein hazaar namazon se behtar hai, siwae Masjid Haram ke.'"
"567","[AI-translation] Tariq bin Shihab se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Jab Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) shaheed kiye gae to Umm Aiman (Raziyallahu anha) ne kaha: 'Aaj Islam kamzor ho gaya.' Rawi ne kaha: Sufyan kabhi Qais ki hadees mein kahte: Unhon ne un (Umm Aiman) se kaha: Na ro. Unhon ne kaha: Main aasman se khabar par roti hun. Ishaq (rawi) ne kaha: Ham is ko Sufyan ki taraf se ghalti samajhte hain."
"568","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ek din farmaya: 'Main chahunga ke mera ek sahabi mere sath ho, taake main us se shikayat karun aur us se baat karun.' Unhon ne kaha: Main ne gumaan kiya ke Aap Abu Bakr (Raziyallahu anhu) se milna chahenge, to main ne kaha: Kya main Aap ke liye Abu Bakr (Raziyallahu anhu) ko bulaun? Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Nahin.' Main ne kaha: Kya main Aap ke liye Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) ko bulaun? Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Nahin.' Main ne kaha: Kya main Aap ke liye Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) ko bulaun? Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Nahin.' Main ne kaha: Kya main Aap ke liye Usman (Raziyallahu anhu) ko bulaun? Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Han.' Unhon ne kaha: Main ne Usman (Raziyallahu anhu) ko bulaya, aur woh aae. Jab woh ghar mein the to Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mujh se farmaya: 'Door hato.' To main door hat gai, aur Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Usman (Raziyallahu anhu) ko apne qareeb kiya, yahan tak ke un ka ghutna Aap ke ghutne se lag gaya. Unhon ne kaha: Phir Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Usman (Raziyallahu anhu) se baat karne lage, aur Usman ke chehre ka rang surkh hone laga. Unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) un se baat karte rahe, aur un ka chehra surkh hota raha, phir Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un se farmaya: 'Jao.' To woh chale gae. Jab un ke ghar ke gherao ka din aaya to unhon ne Usman (Raziyallahu anhu) se kaha: Tum jang kyun nahin karte? Unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mujh se ahad liya tha, aur main us par qayam rahunga. Unhon (Aishah Raziyallahu anha) ne kaha: Ham ne samjha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un se is waqiye ke bare mein ahad liya tha."
"569","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke woh Asma bint Umais (Raziyallahu anha) ke paas se guzre aur kaha: 'Kya woh Habshiyah hai?' Is se un ki murad woh sarzameen thi jahan woh Najashi ke sath the. Unhon (Asma Raziyallahu anha) ne kaha: 'Aey Ibn Khattab! Kya tum ne is ke siwa kuch irada kiya?' Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha: 'Tum behtareen log ho agar tum hijrat mein peeche na rahe hote.' Unhon ne kaha: 'Tum Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath the; woh tumhare jahil aur be-ilm logon ko sikhate, aur tumhare paidal chalne walon ko sawari dete. Phir main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki khidmat mein aai aur Aap ko yeh waqiya sunaya. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Nahin, balke tumhare liye do hijraten hain.' Yani Habshah ki sarzameen ki taraf hijrat aur Madina ki taraf hijrat."
"570","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Makkah haram hai. Allah ne use us din se hurmat wala qarar diya jis din Us ne aasmanon aur zameen aur suraj aur chaand ko paida kiya. Woh mujh se pahle kisi ke liye halal nahin hua ke us mein jang kare, aur na mere baad kisi ke liye halal hoga. Woh mere liye sirf din ke thode hisse mein halal hua, phir woh apni pahli haalat mein wapas ho gaya. Us ki ghaas na kaati jae, na us ke darakht, aur na us ka shikar daraaya jae, aur na wahan giri hui cheez uthai jae siwae woh jo us ka elan kare.' Abbas (Raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Siwae Izkhir (ek qism ki ghaas) ke, kyunke Ahle Makkah us ke baghair nahin rah sakte. Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Siwae Izkhir ghaas ke (use kaatna jaiz hai).'"
"571","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Jab aam bachche subah uthte to un ki aankhon ke kinaron mein safed mail hoti. Jabke jab Muhammad (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) subah uthte to Aap ki aankhen bilkul saaf aur chamakdar hotin."
